6. INVENTORY MANAGEMENT

UNIVMAR must manage physical stone inventory.

Inventory can be managed by:
- Material
- Variant
- Lot
- Bundle
- Slab

For the first version, lot/bundle level can be the main stock unit.

Inventory information:
- Material
- Finish
- Thickness
- Quantity
- Unit
- Warehouse
- Rack / location
- Supplier
- Lot or bundle number
- Purchase cost
- Arrival date
- Available quantity
- Reserved quantity
- Damaged quantity
- Status

Important stock values:

On Hand:
Physical quantity currently present.

Reserved:
Quantity already allocated to customer orders.

Available:
Quantity that can still be sold.

Available = On Hand - Reserved


