- Notes

Delivery statuses:
- PLANNED
- PREPARING
- DISPATCHED
- DELIVERED
- FAILED
- CANCELLED

When material physically leaves the warehouse:
- On Hand decreases.
- Reserved quantity decreases.
- Reservation becomes consumed.


