31. DAMAGE & BREAKAGE MANAGEMENT

Stone can be damaged:
- During transport
- In the warehouse
- During handling
- During fabrication
- During installation

The system should record:
- Material/slab
- Quantity
- Reason
- Photo
- Responsible operation
- Cost impact
- Date

Damaged stock must no longer appear as normal available stock.


32. RETURNS

