40. FINAL PRODUCT POSITIONING

UNIVMAR should be designed as:

Stone Industry ERP
+
CRM
+
Inventory Management
+
B2B Sales Platform
+
Order & Delivery Management

The strongest part of the project should be the connection between commercial operations and physical stone inventory.

A quotation should not exist independently from stock.
An order should not exist independently from inventory reservation.
A delivery should affect physical inventory.
A cancellation should release reserved inventory.
A purchase receipt should increase inventory.
Every important operation should be traceable.

This makes UNIVMAR a realistic stone-company management platform instead of a generic CRUD or e-commerce application.